  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Update Profinet Plugin",
  "description": "Hello all,\n\nI've attached patches for the Profinet Plugin that perform the following changes:\n\n* Decode QualifiedChannelDiagnosis and cleanup diagnosis data decoding\n* Correctly name ModuleDiffBlock bits\n* Decode ControlBlockPlug\n* Update Block Type List according to PN AL Protocol d24MU2 Oct 2020 spec\n* Add 10BASET1L MAU Type\n* Add APL MAUTypeExtension value\n* Decode PDPortDataRealExtended block\n* Dissect OwnPort block\n* Dissect Neighbors block\n* Improve dissecting PDPortDataReal\n\nPlease apply :-)\n\nBest regards Dirk Ziegelmeier\n\n(Profinet developer at Pepperl+Fuchs SE, Germany)",
